  "title": "Xbox Prices Surge in EU and UK",
  "summary": "Xbox experienced a major outage that started Sunday evening, affecting both digital game access and disc-based game functionality. The outage caused users to be unable to play their games or access their discs. According to the Verge All Posts report, Microsoft announced its latest round of Xbox price bumps in June, with US pricing being the only one given. Now, we know the EU and UK pricing increases are dramatic, with Xbox prices now starting at €499.99 or £429.99, depending on the model.",
